id: SCA-041
title: Gemfile git source without ref pin
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Gemfile
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: gem\s+['"][^'"]+['"],\s*git:\s*['"][^'"]+['"]
    message: Git-sourced gem without a pinned ref/tag/commit gets latest code from branch at install time. A compromised repo delivers malicious code silently.
fix: Always pin git-sourced gems to a specific commit — gem 'name', git: 'url', ref: '<sha>'.
